Individual Module Waveforms

This folder contains individual simulation waveform screenshots for the modules of the 32-bit RISC-V Single-Cycle Processor.

Included Waveforms

1. Program Counter (PC)
2. Instruction Memory
3. Control Unit
4. Register File
5. Immediate Generator
6. Arithmetic Logic Unit (ALU)
7. PC + 4 Adder
8. Data Memory

Each waveform demonstrates the functionality and simulation behaviour of its respective module.
